# Text is stored with LF and checked out with CRLF, as .editorconfig asks: this is a Windows
# repository - msbuild, the C++ toolset, the .cmd scripts - and cmd.exe can misread a batch
# file whose lines end in LF alone when it jumps to a label.
* text=auto eol=crlf

*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
*.snk binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.pdb binary
